{
  "sequence_id": "seq_1c1d4f5e71a2f554",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Is there some kind of problem with that?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Are you kidding me!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It's only fish. Why can't you just touch it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It's ITAWRISH!  First"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "On"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It's all slimy and slippery and cold!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It feels like it's alive!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I can't..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Just thinking about it is making me sick..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I'm gonna be honest, you sound kind of like a little girl right now..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It's not like it'll actually be live fish, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "And if you don't use it, it'll just get thrown away!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "That would be rude to the fish!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T14",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I don't even know how to respond to that..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Well, if it isn't alive,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Then I guess I could just barely do it..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Someone told me"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "that they even got a fish tank last year."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Wow, they're really going all out."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It'll be kind of gross."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Think you'll be okay?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "DAUGHTER OF THE PRESIDENT OF A SHIP- BUILDING (OMPANY"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I'm a doctor's son, Remem- her?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I'll be fine."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "SON OF A Hospital DIRE(For"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "That sounds like they're going to be alive..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "We're going to be cutting up live fish, aren't we?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "\"Well, well,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "You do need that to keep them alive..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I can't even touch DEAD fish! and now they're going to be alive!!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "You have GOT to be kidding me!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "W..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Well, telling me isn't going to solve any- thing..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "If we do cooking practice like this..."
    }
  ],
